OL,3,GNEWSAStone to be laid for Mobo founder
OL,4,AKanya King
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Paving the Way stone will be
OL,7,Funveiled on 18 November at her former
OL,8,Fschool, Queens Park Community College
OL,9,Fin Queen's Park, north-west London.
